Slow digestion's not very useful this late; really, after sokoban I'd
usually prefer uncursed =hunger over =sd, unless I'm playing foodless
or something.  If Sokoban didn't put you permanently over the top food-
wise, the Castle sure should've.  Conflict is awesome.

> The only intrinsics I'm missing are disintegration resistance and
> teleport control, and the latter will be taken care of very soon when
> i reverse-genocide tengu.

Disintegration resistance is almost completely worthless, I never
bother unless I happen to have a tinning kit on me when I kill a black
dragon.
Telecontrol is great, especially for the ascension run.  =conflict and
=telecontrol would've been much more useful wishes than the T-shirt/
GoP, though markers probably still outrank them.

